      "notes": [
        "1. Item 1 is cut from the KC-01-1021 production file of the same revision.",
        "2. Item 3 is two complete 7in TFT Display Drivers to their own drawing package (KC-01-1910). Info Display 1 is the panel hub: its CN1 goes to Ctrl Module CN4 and the Annunciator plugs into its slot P2 (Hardware Reference §4.2).",
        "3. The power button (item 2) is wired to Ctrl Module H1 (soft latch); the master cannot see it.",
        "4. The DFPlayer (item 5) plugs into the DFPlayer socket of the Annunciator's display driver.",
        "5. All sheets at 2:5 on A3. Parts list on sheet 3."
